Okay, it was a bug. (The relevant artifacts were all non-cursed, in
fact blessed, so that wasn't it.)

The bug in question? I killed two different Quest-Baddies. Each had a
silver bell. When I saw the second bell, I got the "program in
disorder" message. (Quit? Me? Shyeah!) Anyway, that screwed things
just a little, which kept me from getting into the Moloch level.

To unscrew things, I dropped the bell and picked it up again.
(Simple!) I got another "program in disorder" message, which I
ignored. The ritual worked, and it was On to Moloch.

Thanks to everyone for the suggestions, and especially thanks to Stan
"T2" Wen for giving me the suggestion that worked.
